== Part A: data from the PDF formulas ==
  61 low bins; L range 3..24270; theta range 27..133874; J=32 with truncation active in 24 bins
  M = L >= 64 (delay branch eligible) in 53 bins, renewal forced (L < 64) in 8
== Part B: exact combinatorics ==
  Eulerian E_r = carry law for r <= 70 (incl.-excl.), r <= 12 (exact convolution)
  T_e = (exp Q - X^{e+1} exp(XQ))/(1-X) mod X^N on 12 random toy Q (24 identities)
== Part C: low-kernel majorants d*_j vs rigorous rho ==
  rho series validated: closed form on [2,3], continuity at 3..59, integral equation, rho(3), rho(10)
  delay M=64 on j <= 2560: acceptance fails (upper endpoint first increases at j=364, u=5.69)
  delay M=100 on j <= 4000: acceptance fails (upper endpoint first increases at j=599, u=5.99)
  delay M=1000 on j <= 40000: acceptance fails (upper endpoint first increases at j=7458, u=7.46)
  renewal and delay majorants enclose rho at 21570 grid points (rho to 1e-40 accuracy)
